<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Brainzy Privacy Policy</title><style>body{font:16px/1.6 system-ui,sans-serif;max-width:720px;margin:32px auto;padding:0 18px;color:#1b1f3a}h1{font-size:28px}h2{margin-top:28px}li{margin:6px 0}</style></head><body><h1>Privacy Policy for Brainzy</h1>
<p><i>Last updated: 11-Oct-2026</i></p>
<p>This policy explains how the Brainzy app (&quot;the app&quot;, &quot;we&quot;) handles information. Please replace the bracketed items with your own details before publishing.</p>
<p><b>Developer:</b> Rizwan Malvat</p>
<p><b>Contact:</b> rizmalvat@gmail.com</p>
<h2>What we collect</h2>
<p>We do not ask you to create an account and we do not collect your name, email address, contacts, photos or precise location.</p>
<p>Your game progress (stars, levels reached, settings such as theme and sound) is stored <b>only on your device</b>. We cannot see it. Uninstalling the app removes it.</p>
<h2>Advertising</h2>
<p>The app is free and shows ads provided by <b>Google AdMob</b>. To show and measure ads, Google may collect and use information from your device, such as your advertising ID, IP address (approximate location), device and app information, and how you interact with ads. Ads can be personalised or non-personalised depending on your choices.</p>
<li>In the European Economic Area, the United Kingdom and similar regions you will be asked for consent before personalised ads are used. You can change your choice at any time in the app under **Settings &gt; Ad privacy choices**.</li><li>On Android you can reset or delete your advertising ID, or opt out of ad personalisation, in your device settings (Settings &gt; Privacy &gt; Ads).</li><li>Learn more about how Google uses data: https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites</li>
<h2>Sharing</h2>
<p>We do not sell your personal information. Information is shared only with Google as described above, and with the share sheet of your device when you choose to share your progress.</p>
<h2>Children</h2>
<p>The app is not directed to children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>
<h2>Security</h2>
<p>Ad requests are sent over encrypted connections. Because we store no personal data on our own servers, there is nothing for us to leak or delete.</p>
<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>If this policy changes we will update the date above and publish the new version at the same address.</p>
<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>Questions? Email [YOUR EMAIL ADDRESS].</p></body></html>
